{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/89640-i-realized-something-interesting-about-tokens-today","id":89640,"title":"I realized something interesting about Tokens today.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-12T12:23:22-07:00","id":89640,"title":"I realized something interesting about Tokens today.","content":"A Token is a mundane object that is taken from the mortal world into the Hedge, where it is infused with mad fae magic, though to human eyes it looks perfectly ordinary. Obviously this is a parallel to changelings themselves (and both have reflections in the True Fae manifestations of Actor and Prop, respectively).<br /> <br /> However, when Hedgespinning is introduced to the mix, something cool happens, theme-wise.<br /> <br /> No one really knows what makes a Token a Token. You throw a yo-yo into a brier patch and come back in a week, hoping for the best. It's out of your hands and is up to fate, which is often cruel or at least ironic. When you Hedgespin a Token, though, you're taking control of fate. The necessary ephemeral ingredients require a story, but it's a story you go out and make yourself.<br /> <br /> All changelings suffered a terrible fate at the hands of their Keepers. But once they've escaped Arcadia, their destinies are, theoretically, their own to forge. You can join the Courts or go it alone. You can kill your Fetch or try to come to some accord with it. You can reclaim your mortal life or carve out a new one made of dreams and promises.<br /> <br /> You can rely on fate-dictated Tokens or you can dictate fate yourself with Hedgespun.<br /> <br /> Getting a cool magic item out of it is only secondary to its true purpose: Hedgespinning is about empowerment, and taking your destiny back for yourself, for better or for worse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}